SUMMARY:[Nextdoor] storm-response
DESCRIPTION:After a North Texas storm\, a quick neighborly checklist befor
 e you call anyone: walk your yard for shingle pieces\, check gutters for g
 ranules\, look at ceilings and closets for fresh stains\, and photograph a
 nything you find. That record helps whether or not you ever file a claim. 
 Family-run Plano roofer\, glad to take a look.
